editor_description = "assets/23: the wall clock's Looks (day-and-exterior.md, The wall clock): the old living room's clock. The origin is the centre of its back, on the wall; its face looks along +Z. hour_hand and minute_hand (under Model) pivot on the dial's centre and turn about their z, a negative angle clockwise, as the old _show_time turned them; at rest both point at 12. No collider (the old clock never collided)."

